
@OrderApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5208

### 1. Kiem tra API
GET {{OrderApi_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast
Accept: application/json

### 2. Tao don hang
POST {{OrderApi_HostAddress}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### 3. Xem chi tiết đơn hàng
GET {{OrderApi_HostAddress}}/orders/2
Accept: application/json